  "_doc_prologue": "The prologue (no has_starter): Ash's menu is RUN, HIDE, THROW SOMETHING (rock / sand). cost: stamina points (100 = his full bar), his first action x(1 + early_k), the second x(1 + early_k/2). hide.found: the chance it finds him in the grass for each of its moves that turn; hide.disengage: added to its chance to lose interest (x0.3 for an aggressive one). run: base + fear_k x fear + anger_k x anger - per_acc_stage x its aim stage, clamped to min..max."
